WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.070
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.070 --> 00:00:08.520
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:13.820
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.410
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.370
The sky is calling

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:27.880
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:34.260
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:42.390
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:44.730
Run and Run!

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:46.690
Run and Run!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.270
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:56.990
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:04.790
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.000
That's right!     It is young

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:15.010
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:25.540
<i>As Silver and the pack helped
Akame with Kurojaki</i>

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:27.970
<i>John arrived from Ouu.</i>

00:01:29.170 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>He announced that Akakabuto
recruited Madara and Mosa-</i>

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:36.900
<i>- and black bears from the entire
Kanto region of Ouu to the Twin Pass.</i>

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:41.860
<i>The day of the decisive battle is near.
It's urgent now to gather males.</i>

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:47.460
<i>And Pluton leader Ben, who by
poisoning is losing sight-</i>

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.080
<i>- plans to hand over
the command to Silver.</i>

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:56.080
<i>Silver happened to hear this
and felt a heavy sense of duty.</i>

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:08.140
FORWARD<i>!</i> THE LITTLE LEADER

00:02:16.850 --> 00:02:19.360
What is this big pond?

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:22.860
Oh yeah! You have
never seen the sea.

00:02:24.110 --> 00:02:25.110
Sea?

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:28.370
This is not a pond, but the sea.

00:02:28.390 --> 00:02:29.870
It is wide.

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:32.120
And beyond that is other countries.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.370
Other countries?

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.870
You mean "abroad" as
you have been in...

00:02:43.970 --> 00:02:45.680
I can see a foreign country!

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:49.180
That is not a foreign country.
It's Shikoku.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.430
Shikoku?

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:54.680
I often went there when
I was in the circus.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:58.020
They have tremendously
strong males there.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:00.150
Are they strong?

00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:04.600
Yeah! Fighting dogs.
Dogs who are born to fight.

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:05.900
Fighting dogs...

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:09.660
Ben, can I go to Shikoku?

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:10.410
What?

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:14.160
I'll meet up with the Fighting dogs,
and bring the strongest males!

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:17.860
Are you going to swim
across this sea?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:19.110
Yup!

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:21.460
It's impossible for you.

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.460
But... I have to try!

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:24.260
No!

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:25.160
But...

00:03:33.780 --> 00:03:36.560
Everyone! Make sure you
rest well tonight.

00:03:36.590 --> 00:03:38.310
It will be tough journey tomorrow.

00:03:40.060 --> 00:03:41.060
Ben!

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:47.650
<i>I knew that Silver would not settle to just take over the leadership.</i>

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.400
<i>But I didn't think he would start
working alone this fast.</i>

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:53.410
Ben!

00:03:53.810 --> 00:03:54.510
Silver!

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:58.160
Do you really want to go alone?

00:03:58.500 --> 00:03:59.670
I have to go.

00:03:59.710 --> 00:04:01.940
Ben will never be
able to cross the sea.

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:03.920
What do you mean?

00:04:03.960 --> 00:04:07.220
The poison has made
him start to lose sight.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:08.170
His sight?

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:12.180
That's understandable.
I thought he was going crazy.

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.830
We can't leave Ben here!

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:19.180
That's why I have to go myself!
Can you keep it quiet from him?

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:22.680
Okay. But I'm coming along.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.400
Hey! Don't take all
the glory for yourself!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.650
I will go as well!

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.200
We will also go!

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:31.700
You need me if you wanna
meet the Fighting dogs.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.200
Thanks, everyone!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.440
It's good that you understand.
If you understand.

00:05:08.390 --> 00:05:09.640
Looks pretty fierce.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.140
Are you sure about this?

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:11.850
Of course!

00:05:12.180 --> 00:05:13.640
I only have tonight to leave!

00:05:14.390 --> 00:05:17.270
But ... to sneak out like this.
It doesn't feel right.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.600
You don't need to worry!

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:21.440
I've asked Moss to take care of Ben.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.610
Mr. Akame!

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:28.570
Let's hurry before the tide changes.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:32.410
I understand.

00:05:35.660 --> 00:05:36.330
<i>Ben!</i>

00:05:36.710 --> 00:05:40.290
<i>I will come back with
the strongest males!</i>

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:43.840
<i>Please watch over me until then.</i>

00:05:52.560 --> 00:05:55.310
Okay, I will go!
Follow me!

00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:23.340
Huh... Seems like I need to
do something about that.

00:06:25.340 --> 00:06:26.880
Silver!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.760
Silver!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.010
Silver!

00:06:34.100 --> 00:06:34.890
Cross!

00:06:36.640 --> 00:06:37.810
Let him go.

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:38.560
Ben?

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.980
He is a male.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.440
Once the burning desire has started,
you gotta wait until it burns out.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:45.820
Ben...

00:06:46.280 --> 00:06:47.650
Did you know about this?

00:06:47.650 --> 00:06:50.990
I couldn't let him go, because
he might not be able to do it.

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:53.780
But if it's silver, I'm sure he will.

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:57.450
<i>Silver...</i>

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:04.380
I'm counting on you, Silver.
Good luck.

00:07:11.720 --> 00:07:15.760
<i>Silver's group continued to swim
through the fierce waves to Shikoku.</i>

00:07:16.600 --> 00:07:18.930
<i>To find the strongest males.</i>

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.730
<i>The passion drove them and
gave them powers to swim.</i>

00:07:22.960 --> 00:07:25.190
<i>They just kept swimming.</i>

00:07:50.590 --> 00:07:51.760
Go, Musashi!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.180
What are you doing, Nioryu!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.340
Don't worry, Nioryu!

00:07:54.340 --> 00:07:55.450
There you go, Musashi!

00:07:55.450 --> 00:07:56.350
Go, go!

00:07:56.810 --> 00:07:57.450
Hey, hey!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.860
Stop it! Nioryu will be killed!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:13.660
Hey there, Musashi!

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:14.300
Let go!

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.320
Let go!

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:17.660
Musashi is incredible!

00:08:18.240 --> 00:08:19.540
A Tosa Fighting dog.

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.960
Musashi defeated his
rival in a few seconds-

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:26.170
Yokozuna = grand champion
<i>- and kept his title as Yokozuna
of Japans midsize dogs.</i>

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.090
No fighting dog could
measure up with Musashi.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.280
What is it, Musashi?

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:42.170
Why are you guys growling?

00:08:48.860 --> 00:08:52.240
That's the Fighting dogs
champion, Musashi!

00:09:11.760 --> 00:09:13.630
Who's there?!

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:15.260
Don't hide, come out!

00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.510
We want to talk about something.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.140
It won't take long.

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.560
Please borrow us your time.

00:09:26.480 --> 00:09:28.310
What are you gonna do if I refuse?

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.440
Then we take you by force.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.690
By force?

00:09:40.870 --> 00:09:41.680
Bastard!

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:42.450
Stop!

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:45.080
If you move,
I will break this neck

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:46.290
You rotten...!

00:09:46.310 --> 00:09:47.790
Piece of shit

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:49.460
Don't!

00:09:57.220 --> 00:10:00.050
You risked your life when
I was in good spirits.

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:01.930
So I'll overlook this.

00:10:01.960 --> 00:10:03.180
Hurry, and go!

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:06.100
Musashi! What is it?

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:06.890
Crap!

00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.070
Sad to come home empty handed.

00:10:15.070 --> 00:10:17.950
He's a fighting professional.

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:19.610
Wait!

00:10:19.990 --> 00:10:21.200
What is it, big brother?

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:21.800
Shhh!

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:22.760
Hide!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.830
Someone is following us.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.800
What a great number!

00:10:36.810 --> 00:10:38.310
We must tell Silver.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:42.320
Big brother, we never escape!

00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:43.570
Don't say anything!

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:44.570
Here they come!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.630
Damn, they're persistent!

00:10:54.700 --> 00:10:55.580
Don't let them escape!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:58.330
Alright, let's do this!

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.830
Kurotora, don't!

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.300
Come on, you son of a bitches!

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:11.050
Kurotora, escape!

00:11:17.300 --> 00:11:17.980
Escape!

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:19.830
You must warn Silver!

00:11:24.730 --> 00:11:26.230
Who is it?
That scream!

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:28.490
Was it the Kai brothers?

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:29.990
Then, we run!

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:37.750
Someone's coming!

00:11:42.960 --> 00:11:43.960
It is...

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.470
Musashi?

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:52.600
The Kai brothers failed
in the negotiations!

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:55.600
Akatora!

00:11:57.600 --> 00:11:59.850
You bastard! How dare
you hurt Akatora?

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:00.860
Not fair!

00:12:00.900 --> 00:12:03.070
Is this how Tosa Fighting dogs fight?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:09.950
You villain!

00:12:11.010 --> 00:12:11.910
Calm down!

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.700
Are you so impatient that you cannot
distinguish between friend and enemy?

00:12:17.290 --> 00:12:18.410
Wait...

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.170
Musashi helped me.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.170
It was mountain dogs that attacked us...

00:12:24.190 --> 00:12:25.550
Mountain dogs?

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.550
That's right. They live in the mountains-

00:12:27.550 --> 00:12:31.260
And my fighting dog friends say their
leader is called The Bandit Bill.

00:12:31.300 --> 00:12:32.300
The Bandit Bill?

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:51.740
I've heard rumors about you.

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.530
And been waiting for you all.

00:12:56.740 --> 00:13:01.990
I like, that the first thing you did
on Shikoku was coming to me.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.500
So... So you will come with us?

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:10.250
Yes, young male.
Your eyes are not lying.

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:14.260
I've nothing more to gain from
the world of Fighting dogs.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.510
My life is in your hands.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:18.020
Thank you, Mr Musashi!

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:21.520
Akame!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:25.770
Chutora and Kurotora was taken
to a mountain temple over there.

00:13:25.770 --> 00:13:29.270
The Mountain temple?
What does Bill have in mind?

00:13:29.780 --> 00:13:33.070
They are alive.
We can't just abandon them.

00:13:33.100 --> 00:13:34.570
As Silver says.

00:13:34.570 --> 00:13:37.490
We cannot abandon those who came
along with us to this island!

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:39.070
That's right!
That's right!
That's right!

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.080
OK, I understand.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:46.290
I'll get some fighting dogs.
Wait here.

00:13:46.550 --> 00:13:47.550
What do you mean?

00:13:47.800 --> 00:13:51.550
If we have fighting dogs,
Bill will hesitate to attack.

00:13:51.550 --> 00:13:55.050
I guess you would rather have
a conversation than fight, right?

00:13:55.070 --> 00:13:55.670
Yes!

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.970
Our only enemy is Akakabuto!

00:13:58.010 --> 00:13:59.310
Then wait here.

00:13:59.620 --> 00:14:01.560
I'll be back at dawn.

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:06.810
I'm sorry, Silver!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.150
Silver...

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.490
Wake up, everyone!

00:14:18.410 --> 00:14:19.670
Silver is gone!

00:14:19.740 --> 00:14:20.440
What?

00:14:20.640 --> 00:14:21.570
He can't have?

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:34.880
Ben, what I'm trying to
do is not wrong, right?

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:38.760
<i>But... if something happens...</i>

00:14:42.220 --> 00:14:43.770
D-Daisuke!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.040
Oh, you are!

00:15:04.470 --> 00:15:05.140
Sniper!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.210
Guest!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.540
A strange guy is coming.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:11.290
What?

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:13.790
Here it is.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.260
Hey kid!
What are you doing here?

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:23.300
I represent The Leader of Ouu,
and want to see your boss.

00:15:23.320 --> 00:15:24.550
Please hear me out!

00:15:25.050 --> 00:15:25.650
Silver!

00:15:25.910 --> 00:15:27.050
That's not gonna happen.

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.240
Sniper!

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.810
What are you doing here?

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:34.820
If you say you represent
the leader of Ouu.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.570
You've been promoted, Silver.

00:15:37.400 --> 00:15:41.240
This is the one who is
trying to take over Shikoku!

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:43.300
It's a lie!
I'm not here to fight!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:43.930
Silence!

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:45.120
Get him!

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:48.620
He's escaping!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:51.380
Silver, don't come here!

00:15:51.590 --> 00:15:54.550
It's a trap!
Don't worry about us, run!

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:55.380
What are you saying?

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:57.130
I can't abandon friends!

00:15:59.630 --> 00:16:00.880
Silver, above you!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:09.810
Dammit!

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:12.810
I got you, Silver!

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:13.900
Cowardly done!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:16.420
Try to fight me fair
and square for once.

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:17.280
All right!

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.260
I'll send you to hell!

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:20.280
Enemy attack!

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:21.280
What?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:23.910
John!

00:16:23.950 --> 00:16:25.700
They are here... Right on time.

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:26.950
Attack them, everyone!

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:39.780
Don't move!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:43.220
If you move, he dies!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.080
Stop, everyone!

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:51.980
Stop fighting!

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:54.730
That's right.

00:16:55.100 --> 00:16:58.480
He will end up dead if you
even show your teeth.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:16:59.790
Dammit!

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.490
Now they can't fight!

00:17:04.490 --> 00:17:05.990
OK, on them!

00:17:06.660 --> 00:17:07.950
You bastard!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:12.620
Silver!

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.130
Silver, what do we do?

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:20.630
This is an execution!

00:17:21.260 --> 00:17:25.390
Silver, don't care about us!
Let us die like males.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:28.640
Hurry up, otherwise
we will all die!

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:29.890
Silver?!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:36.900
Stop it!

00:17:36.900 --> 00:17:39.880
I won't allow such methods.

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.400
I'll take care of those
who try to invade.

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:47.400
Is it their boss?

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:51.160
Bill, I'm just fighting smart.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:53.420
We have not come to fight!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.920
Don't be fooled, Bill!

00:17:55.170 --> 00:17:56.420
Attack them at once!

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:03.460
Stop, Bill!

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:08.220
Mr Musashi!

00:18:15.730 --> 00:18:19.230
Bill, you've heard about them, right?

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:20.490
Yes!

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:23.010
But their Commander says
something different.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:26.110
He says they came to
take over Shikoku.

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:26.790
Wrong!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.740
He's not our Commander anymore!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.240
He's a traitor!

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.750
Silent! I'm still your Commander!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:34.910
I understand.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.750
It's an internal affair.

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:37.750
Well, Bill?

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:40.530
Shall we let them settle
this themselfs in the ring?

00:18:45.380 --> 00:18:46.510
Certainly.

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.610
B-Bill?

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.060
Fight me male against male!

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:50.270
What, kid!
Fight me male against male!

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:51.510
What, kid!

00:18:53.510 --> 00:18:55.230
All right.
I'll be your opponent.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:03.950
Silver!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:04.700
Wait, John!

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:05.950
Let them fight.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:08.950
In case of emergency, we'll help him.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:09.950
Damn...

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:13.200
Now look at this.
I'm gonna break his neck.

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:29.900
Ben...

00:19:29.930 --> 00:19:30.930
Daisuke...

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.190
Die!

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:41.020
What was that sound?

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:42.520
He crushed his neck!

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.030
This is unforgivable!

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:45.900
Stop, Mr. Akame!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.030
What?

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:52.290
<i>The collar...</i>

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.290
<i>That's what sounded?</i>

00:19:54.790 --> 00:19:56.040
<i>Saved...</i>

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:00.290
<i>Thank you, Daisuke.</i>

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:01.290
Sniper!

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.540
You know why I'm called
"Silver the Shooting Star"?

00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:06.300
I will show you what I mean!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.890
He disappeared!

00:20:12.390 --> 00:20:13.850
Silver is...

00:20:14.180 --> 00:20:15.180
Where is Silver?

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.440
That little kid!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.440
You, damn...!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:38.410
Damn! Let me go!

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:51.470
Well done, Silver!

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.510
Take me down!
Hurry take me down!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:20:58.020
<i>I can't believe it, that kid.</i>

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.560
<i>They are really great
males as I've heard...</i>

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:07.070
Shit, you son of a bitch!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.320
Sniper, you get one more
chance to make amends!

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:14.370
So reflect on what you did!

00:21:14.510 --> 00:21:17.330
Silent!
Take me down quickly!

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:18.580
Let me down!

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.580
Thank you, Mr Musashi.

00:21:21.580 --> 00:21:22.710
Thank you, Mr Bill.

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:26.340
No, I'm not on your side yet.

00:21:26.920 --> 00:21:31.340
Bill, if you insist on fighting,
I'm gonna fight you as well!

00:21:33.590 --> 00:21:34.840
What's so funny?

00:21:43.560 --> 00:21:49.860
When I see this kid, I wanna
know who their Leader of Ouu is.

00:21:50.630 --> 00:21:52.990
So you'll come with us, Mr Bill?

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:56.010
Just call me Bill.
As of today, I'm your comrade.

00:21:56.490 --> 00:21:57.740
Bill?

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:02.500
Good! Let's go back to
Ben and his group.

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.750
Wait!

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:06.900
In Shikoku there is a
male stronger than me.

00:22:06.920 --> 00:22:07.520
Yeah?

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:09.670
Is there a male
stronger than you?

00:22:09.750 --> 00:22:11.750
The strongest male in the world.

00:22:11.780 --> 00:22:14.250
Is there really such a male?

00:22:14.500 --> 00:22:15.750
Well, Silver?

00:22:15.760 --> 00:22:18.260
Of course...
We'll meet up with him!

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:30.520
<i>Silver's selflessness
for his friends-</i>

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:35.610
<i>- moved Fighting dog, Musashi
and The Bandit Bill, in the heart.</i>

00:22:36.030 --> 00:22:39.030
<i>He successfully got them
into the pack.</i>

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:45.540
<i>And there is a male who is said
to be the strongest in the world.</i>

00:22:46.490 --> 00:22:50.290
<i>Silver and his group are on their
way to Uwajima to meet that male.</i>

00:22:52.630 --> 00:22:55.770
<i>Silver grows more and more
into the role as leader.</i>

00:22:55.770 --> 00:22:57.880
To be continued...
<i>Silver grows more and more
into the role as leader.</i>

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:00.230
To be continued...

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:20.130
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.100 --> 00:23:26.260
bathes you gently

00:23:27.360 --> 00:23:32.400
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.240 --> 00:23:40.960
let it flow away

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:46.960
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.260 --> 00:23:53.590
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:59.770
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.600 --> 00:24:05.650
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
